%% Layered architecture: request flow and dependency direction.
flowchart LR
  C[Client / Bruno / Swagger UI] --> R[Route]
  R --> A[authenticate]
  A --> V[validate - Zod]
  V --> K[Controller]
  K --> S[Service]
  S --> P[Repository]
  P --> D[(SQLite)]

  A -. AppError .-> E[errorHandler]
  V -. AppError .-> E
  S -. AppError .-> E
  P -. AppError .-> E
  D -. unexpected .-> E
  E --> C

  subgraph Wiring["Composition root (routes/index.js)"]
    W1[db + config] --> W2[ProjectRepository]
    W2 --> W3[ProjectService]
    W3 --> W4[ProjectController]
    W4 --> R
  end
